    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Begin the following meditation from tomorrow - and know that this is an order!",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.7604760000000002,
      "end": 5.449206
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Now you are so totally mine that I cannot do anything other than order you!",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/03.mp3",
      "start": 6.6643989999999995,
      "end": 10.477891
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Prerequisites: Do it cheerfully.",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.637642000000001,
      "end": 14.157098
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Do it relaxedly.",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/05.mp3",
      "start": 15.443855000000001,
      "end": 16.621111000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Be playful.",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/06.mp3",
      "start": 17.836938999999997,
      "end": 18.69415
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Do it in the morning after taking a bath.",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/07.mp3",
      "start": 19.880181,
      "end": 21.86458
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The meditation: First: breathe deeply and rhythmically, not fast but slowly, for ten minutes.",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/08.mp3",
      "start": 23.221111,
      "end": 29.595215
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Second: dance rhythmically and slowly; be ecstatic, as if flowing in it, for ten minutes.",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/09.mp3",
      "start": 30.871043,
      "end": 37.073673
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Third: use the mahamantra: hoo-hoo-hoo.",
      "path": "audio/1971-346/10.mp3",
      "start": 38.415488,
      "end": 41.74
    }
  ]
